        "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discord Invite Code:bj9KPB6JBJ</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > or click the social media link on the right side of the store page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Player QQ Group: 434276599</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bilibili Account: 夏鸣游艺</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Story Synopsis ◆</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the year 3323, the revolutionary Meta Mirror Project emerged from the collaboration between humanity and the super AI &quot;Primus.&quot; This ambitious venture seeks to stabilize society and ensure security by repairing the consciousness of individuals struggling with intense emotional turmoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey unfolds as Enforcer Decem, tasked with repairing bizarre Mirrormazes stemming from human minds. Navigate through these mazes, solve puzzles, and confront powerful Mirrormares.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a mission that left Decem severely injured and devoid of memories, the path to rediscovery begins. As Decem relearns the abilities of an Enforcer, a gradual unveiling of the secrets surrounding the Meta Mirror Project ensues.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Innovative Spatial Retrace Mechanism ◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/8da688aeea99596aef98fb7f354aec84.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/8da688aeea99596aef98fb7f354aec84.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/8da688aeea99596aef98fb7f354aec84.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the ability of &quot;Retrace&quot; to teleport back to previously visited locations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this power to outmaneuver foes, launch surprise attacks from blind spots, or devise clever solutions to complex puzzles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ A Diverse Array of Formidable Bosses ◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/c929c722f3bcbb7484c005ecb24ca731.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/c929c722f3bcbb7484c005ecb24ca731.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/c929c722f3bcbb7484c005ecb24ca731.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a diverse array of formidable bosses born from human obsessions in Mirrormazes. Confront colossal mechs wreaking havoc, cunning foes obstructing your view, and shape-shifting entities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite their seeming invincibility, each boss harbors weaknesses waiting to be exploited. Analyze their tactics, use retrace and other skills to counter their attacks, and triumph over these imposing foes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Explore the Unique Art Style ◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/576690298494cd285242cf2e6f23bc20.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/576690298494cd285242cf2e6f23bc20.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/576690298494cd285242cf2e6f23bc20.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a visually stunning world characterized by a soft, vibrant aesthetic. Traverse varied landscapes, from ancient ruins to bustling urban panoramas, ensuring a mesmerizing experience within the Mirrormazes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Customize play-style with Modules ◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/e35e4715273ba326db0c7d858c5cce3c.poster.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/e35e4715273ba326db0c7d858c5cce3c.webm?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/e35e4715273ba326db0c7d858c5cce3c.mp4?t=1770892675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Primary Modules by defeating bosses and discover hidden Secondary Modules scattered across Mirrormazes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your play-style by choosing from 7 Primary Modules and their variations, focusing on counterattacks, raw power, or charged attacks, complemented by over 20 Secondary Modules. Craft your own distinct combat approach.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Shape the Fate of Your Companions ◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179370/extras/0e3208a8f9a3737b08abc0317eaf21a7.avif?t=1770892675\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as &quot;Enforcer Decem,&quot; residing alongside your allies on the Motherboard, venturing into Mirrormazes, and engaging in thoughtful exchanges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel multiple endings influenced by pivotal decisions made throughout the story.</p></li></ul>",
